Package: scp-gui
Version: 0.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-pyqt5, python3-paramiko
Maintainer: You <you@example.com>
Description: Simple GUI SCP/SFTP file transfer client
 A dual-pane graphical file manager for securely transferring files
 to and from remote hosts over SSH (SFTP/SCP), similar in spirit to
 WinSCP. Supports password and private-key authentication, directory
 browsing, and recursive upload/download with progress feedback.
